&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies, from the world&#39;s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups, use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of businesses across the internet run on Stripe. The Stripe Business Network team is building the B2B network that turns that scale into value for every one of them: a place where businesses discover and transact with each other, share verified data, and move money instantly and seamlessly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building the experiences that make that network real. A single view of your entire Stripe network, including every platform, partner, and customer you do business with, where a new relationship is just a click away. Portable identity, so when you start working with a new platform, your verified business information comes with you instead of being collected from scratch. Closed-loop money movement, so paying another Stripe business is instant and costs a fraction of a card payment. A business directory where the right counterparties can find you. And trusted data sharing and profile representation, so counterparties have confidence in who they&#39;re working with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every business that joins makes the network more valuable for everyone already on it. We think of the Business Network as the business graph for the internet economy, and we&#39;re building for what&#39;s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build the Stripe Business Network experiences, including the Network Tab (a single page to see your whole Stripe network), search and discovery, profiles, networked invoicing, and much more, to deliver utility to our users across the board.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That means being a true champion of our users: end-to-end owner of core flows, a cross-functional partner to Engineering, Design, and GTM, and an active voice in shaping the Business Network&#39;s strategy alongside leadership. You&#39;ll define, build, and scale new and existing products, informed by user insights and data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a technical PM who operates with a high degree of autonomy and drive. You care deeply about craft and impact. The only thing that really matters to you is getting well-built products into users&#39; hands. You&#39;re already exploring how AI is changing how products get built and what it means for the PM role; you might even have a few half-finished side projects that prove it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the user&#39;s perspective. Spend time with users, and synthesize their feedback and market signals into clear product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsess over user impact rather than features shipped. Always ask (and quantify) how each release delivers value and utility to our users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive high-velocity, high-craft execution and own outcomes. Lead cross-functional work from discovery through launch, and hold yourself accountable for adoption, user value, and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Stripe&#39;s strategic priorities. Use judgment to factor in Stripe&#39;s strategic positioning and leverage, and make network-accretive product choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner deeply with Engineering, Design, Data Science, Marketing, Sales, and Operations to ship cohesive, frictionless experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a high-agency, high-paced product manager with strong craft to bring the next set of network features to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in a product or technical role, with experience shipping world-class products at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High agency and an ownership mindset. You do whatever it takes to solve problems, delight users, and deliver business impact. You climb walls to get there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High resilience and resourcefulness. You see around corners, think ahead, and find a way where there seemingly isn&#39;t one. You are highly proactive and able to set the pace for a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High taste, design empathy, and sharp judgment. You put yourself in the shoes of users and are a steward of great experiences that deliver real utility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorous with data, including digging into metrics, getting to insight, telling a story with data, and thinking from first principles to deliver the right results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication, with a talent for distilling user problems into precise, actionable framing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive with a high level of autonomy and responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with complex payments or financial products, or building networks and marketplaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building brand-new products or working in a startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with GTM teams to bring new products to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be joining Stripe’s ML Foundations and Gen AI team to incubate new ML applications and improve our Agentic and ML capabilities across Stripe. Our team is responsible for unlocking novel ML and LLM techniques and applications across Stripe’s product suite to drive business outcomes, as well as providing infrastructure, tooling and support for ML teams. Our team is also responsible end to end for delivering our internal productivity agentic tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior product leader, you will be responsible for a portfolio of products, comprising both platforms and end-to-end internal applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead a cross-functional team in charge of radically transforming how Stripes do their day to day work. You will define the vision, priority use cases and adoption strategy for the internal agentic productivity tools thousand of Stripes use every day. You will obsess over crafting an exceptional end-to-end user experience and ensuring user adoption. This is a unique opportunity to have an unprecedented impact on Stripe’s ability to move fast in 2027.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also own our agentic platforms used by all teams building user-facing Agents. You will work closely with product leaders across business units to advance our core AI technology stack and empower those teams to infuse their products with new Agents and agentic capabilities. You will obsess over high quality platform primitives and drive internal adoption.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the vision for how Stripes work in 2027.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver novel agentic internal capabilities and exceptional productivity tools for all teams at Stripe, that radically transform internal efficiency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsess over craft and beauty, adoption and repeat usage of our internal tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute on the Stripe-wide strategy for new Agentic applications across our product suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own customer discovery, product priorities, end-to-end UX, adoption, and outcome measurement across our entire Agentic platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with internal stakeholders to understand platform requirements or adoption blockers and turn that into a roadmap.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for platform adoption and development of new internal or customer facing agentic applications at Stripe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and crisply with leadership stakeholders and drive alignment across multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the requirements below, and has a passion for AI to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience delivering highly successful and innovative software products which are ML powered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of ML, agentic and applied AI tech stacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion and vision for how Agents will transform the way all Stripes will work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence company level strategy and work with business leaders to execute on the transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You push the pace. You take blame and pass the praise. People love working with you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead teams and work cross-functionally in a highly collaborative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze and use quantitative and qualitative data to inform decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding and empathy for consumer and business users — you love building products that make our customers feel joy, delight and trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relentlessly drives product quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of working on both 1P and 3P products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brex is the intelligent finance platform that enables companies to spend smarter and move faster in more than 200 markets. By combining global corporate cards and banking with intuitive spend management, bill pay, and travel software, Brex enables founders and finance teams to accelerate operations, gain real-time visibility, and control spend effortlessly. Brex’s AI-native automation and world-class service eliminate manual expense and accounting tasks for customers so they can focus on what matters most. Tens of thousands of the world&#39;s best companies run on Brex, including DoorDash, Coinbase, Robinhood, Zoom, Plaid, Reddit, and SeatGeek.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Brex allows you to push your limits, challenge the status quo, and collaborate with some of the brightest minds in the industry. We’re committed to building a diverse team and inclusive culture and believe your potential should only be limited by how big you can dream. We make this a reality by empowering you with the tools, resources, and support you need to grow your career.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product at Brex&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Product team is at the forefront of Brex&#39;s mission to empower employees anywhere to make better financial decisions. With a deep understanding of the business, we identify and scope the most impactful opportunities for Brex to tackle. We align cross-functional teams—including Engineering, Legal, Compliance, and Design—on key decisions, set strategy, and drive products from inception to launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Processing a single expense is becoming commoditized. Managing expenses across an enterprise is not. Companies must distribute cards broadly while controlling risk, documenting transactions, enforcing policy, routing approvals, preparing for audit, and producing ERP-ready records.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Product Manager for Expenses, you will turn that complexity into one intelligent system for employees, managers, finance teams, and accountants. You will lead the strategy across documentation, policy, compliance, approvals, substantiation, audit, and accounting readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will align specialized product teams across Engineering, Design, Risk, Compliance, Accounting, and GTM. Using AI and automation, you will eliminate routine work, surface meaningful exceptions, help finance teams close faster, and build capabilities that win major enterprise relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you’ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based in either our San Francisco, Seattle, or New York office. We are a hybrid environment that combines the energy and connections of being in the office with the benefits and flexibility of working from home. We currently require a minimum of three coordinated days in the office per week, Monday, Wednesday and Thursday. As a perk, we also have up to four weeks per year of fully remote work!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end strategy for enterprise expense management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unify documentation, policy, compliance, approvals, substantiation, audit, and ERP readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the systems, data models, configurations, and controls complex enterprises require.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align specialized product teams around the complete expense lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to automate routine work and route only judgment-heavy exceptions to people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Design to make sophisticated enterprise workflows intuitive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align Engineering, Design, Risk, Compliance, Accounting, Sales, and Customer Success around enterprise outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own adoption, workflow completion, manual-work reduction, close speed, retention, and software revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading complex enterprise workflow or systems products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency in backend systems, data models, integrations, and configurable product architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting extensive customer permutations without sacrificing usability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to unite multiple domains under one strategy and operating model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer and Design judgment across employee, manager, finance, and accounting experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concrete judgment about where AI should remove work and where human review matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional influence and an understanding of how product capabilities affect enterprise sales and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expense management experience is preferred; accounting, ERP, procurement, compliance, or adjacent enterprise-software experience can substitute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected salary range for this role is $184,000 - $230,000.&amp;nbsp; However, the starting base pay will depend on a number of factors including the candidate’s location, skills, experience, market demands, and internal pay parity. Depending on the position offered, equity and other forms of compensation may be provided as part of a total compensation package.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware, job-seekers may be at risk of targeting by malicious actors looking for personal data. Brex recruiters will only reach out via LinkedIn or email with a&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://brex.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://brex.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;brex.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;domain. Any outreach claiming to be from Brex via other sources should be ignored.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cloudflare, we are on a mission to help build a better Internet. Today the company runs one of the world’s largest networks that powers millions of websites and other Internet properties for customers ranging from individual bloggers to SMBs to Fortune 500 companies. Cloudflare protects and accelerates any Internet application online without adding hardware, installing software, or changing a line of code. Internet properties powered by Cloudflare all have web traffic routed through its intelligent global network, which gets smarter with every request. As a result, they see significant improvement in performance and a decrease in spam and other attacks. Cloudflare was named to Entrepreneur Magazine’s Top Company Cultures list and ranked among the World’s Most Innovative Companies by Fast Company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cloudflare, we’re not looking for people who wait for a polished roadmap; we’re looking for the builders who see the cracks in the Internet that everyone else has simply learned to live with. We value candidates who have the instinct to spot a &quot;normalized&quot; problem and the AI-native curiosity to create a solution using the latest tools. Our culture is built on iteration, leveraging AI to ship faster today to make it better tomorrow, while ensuring that every improvement, no matter how small, is shared across the team to lift everyone up. If you’re the type of person who values curiosity over bureaucracy, and that AI is a partner in solving tough problems to keep the Internet moving forward, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Available Locations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Austin, US&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;San Francisco, US&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudflare&#39;s self-serve business is the growth engine that powers millions of customers, ranging from solo developers to growing SMBs and larger companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Product Manager for Self-Serve Growth is a technical role that helps optimize and scale the experience for these customers. You will focus on the customer journey from awareness through retention, ensuring our users experience the value of Cloudflare as quickly as possible. This is a highly collaborative, visible, and analytical role that will build, ship, and move quickly without perfect information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problems to work through&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time to value:&lt;/strong&gt; How do we get self-serve users from sign-up to their first successful outcome as fast as possible, reducing friction in their initial setup?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversion &amp;amp; Upgrade Paths:&lt;/strong&gt; How do we help free-tier users naturally discover the value of our paid plans and seamlessly upgrade when the time is right?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onboarding Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Where are users dropping off in the registration and activation flow, and how can we redesign those steps to improve conversion rates?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; How do we design, launch, and measure A/B tests on pricing pages, billing flows, and in-app messaging to drive business metrics?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Desirable Skills, Knowledge, and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Cloudflare, we know that great candidates come from diverse backgrounds with non-linear paths. You don’t need to tick every single box to be right for this role. If you are excited about building a better Internet and ready to make an impact, please apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get Stuff Done: &lt;/strong&gt;You are relentless at execution and driving things forward,&amp;nbsp; even in ambiguous situations. You balance what’s urgent with what’s important and love to ship.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset &amp;amp; Curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; You are eager to learn, highly adaptable, and passionate about understanding how products grow. You proactively ask questions and absorb complex concepts quickly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coding and AX/UX credibility&lt;/strong&gt;: You build with a team of coding agents to ship everything from new features to bug fixes.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;You have an engineering background or understand the modern stack and customer/agent experiences well enough to hold your own with engineers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong analytical baseline. You are comfortable diving into data to understand user behavior, and you can combine quantitative data with qualitative feedback to form hypotheses.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation and Velocity:&lt;/strong&gt; You are excited by the idea of A/B testing. You understand that not every hypothesis will be proven right, but you are eager to ship, measure, learn, and iterate – even if this means getting into very technical implementation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Empathy:&lt;/strong&gt; You can step into the shoes of a self-serve user and advocate for simple, intuitive experiences over complex technical hurdles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You communicate clearly and are excited to partner closely with engineering, design, and product marketing to bring features to the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At Cloudflare it’s pretty helpful to understand how the Internet really works at layers 2 through 7. If you don’t have this, be prepared to speak with mastery about another realm of similar complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation may be adjusted depending on work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Bay Area based hires: Estimated annual salary of $179,000 - $230,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Equity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is eligible to participate in Cloudflare’s equity plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudflare offers a complete package of benefits and programs to support you and your family.&amp;nbsp; Our benefits programs can help you pay health care expenses, support caregiving, build capital for the future and make life a little easier and fun!&amp;nbsp; The below is a description of our benefits for employees in the United States, and benefits may vary for employees based outside the U.S.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Health &amp;amp; Welfare Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical/Rx Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vision Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Spending Accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fertility &amp;amp; Family Forming Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-demand mental health support and Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Travel Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Financial Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short and Long Term Disability Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life &amp;amp; Accident Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) Retirement Savings Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Participation Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Time Off&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible paid time off covering vacation and sick leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leave programs, including parental, pregnancy health, medical, and bereavement leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What Makes Cloudflare Special?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re not just a highly ambitious, large-scale technology company. We’re a highly ambitious, large-scale technology company with a soul. Fundamental to our mission to help build a better Internet is protecting the free and open Internet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.cloudflare.com/protecting-free-expression-online/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Galileo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;: Since 2014, we&#39;ve equipped more than 2,400 journalism and civil society organizations in 111 countries with powerful tools to defend themselves against attacks that would otherwise censor their work, technology already used by Cloudflare’s enterprise customers--at no cost.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cloudflare.com/athenian/&quot;&gt;Athenian Project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;: In 2017, we created the Athenian Project to ensure that state and local governments have the highest level of protection and reliability for free, so that their constituents have access to election information and voter registration. Since the project, we&#39;ve provided services to more than 425 local government election websites in 33 states.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://1.1.1.1/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1.1.1.1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;: We released&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://1.1.1.1/&quot;&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;1.1.1.1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to help fix the foundation of the Internet by building a faster, more secure and privacy-centric public DNS resolver. This is available publicly for everyone to use - it is the first consumer-focused service Cloudflare has ever released. Here’s the deal - we don’t store client IP addresses never, ever. We will continue to abide by our&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.cloudflare.com/1.1.1.1/privacy/public-dns-resolver&quot;&gt; privacy commitment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; and ensure that no user data is sold to advertisers or used to target consumers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Sound like something you’d like to be a part of? We’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please note that applicants who progress to the offer stage of the interview process may be asked to attend an in-person interview within one of the Cloudflare Offices or Cloudflare Hubs.&amp;nbsp; More details about this will be available at that stage of the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This position may require access to information protected under U.S. export control laws, including the U.S. Export Administration Regulations. Please note that any offer of employment may be conditioned on your authorization to receive software or technology controlled under these U.S. export laws without sponsorship for an export license.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
